    "messages": [
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:19",
        "eventSequence": -20,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“印座空着，只能说明铜印不在这里，还不能断定是遭了窃。”\n叶岑拿起台上的提灯，从入口走进柜台工作侧，俯身将灯光照向柜台下方，查看工作位置下的地面与柜台底部。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:21",
        "eventSequence": -18,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“柜台下有一个木箱，不过还不能据此判断铜印在不在里面。”叶岑问你，“你见过铜印最后一次被使用，或被放回什么地方吗？没见过也不要紧。”",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:f4dc5fe0-c5e7-4f14-b17c-92d2e9135ad9",
        "eventSequence": -17,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "我没见过，不知道。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:22",
        "eventSequence": -15,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“明白，那就不从你这里追问这条线索了。”\n叶岑将提灯照向木箱外侧，查看箱面有无归属或用途标识，没有开箱，也没有挪动木箱。",
        "replyToSequence": -17,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:24",
        "eventSequence": -13,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“灯光照到、能看清的木箱外表面上，我没找到可辨认的姓名、归属或用途标识。这还不能确认箱子是谁的、作什么用；没查看的表面和箱内情况仍不清楚。”\n叶岑将提灯放回柜台台面，没有打开或挪动木箱。\n“归属和开箱权限都还没核实，这次外观查看就到这里，不能拿没有标识当作开箱的理由。”",
        "replyToSequence": -17,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:player:2baa3558-c5db-42a7-a780-4bdcd250c98e",
        "eventSequence": -12,
        "role": "player",
        "playerConversation": "present",
        "speakerKey": "player",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "嗯，我在听。",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:25",
        "eventSequence": -10,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "“嗯。箱子的归属还没弄清，先不往里查。我想换个消息来源：确认这里有没有负责开门验货的人在场、方便交谈，再问铜印使用和收存的经过。”",
        "replyToSequence": -12,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:27",
        "eventSequence": -8,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "叶岑向柜台另一端的周成问道：“你最近一次亲眼见到或使用铜印，是在什么时候、什么地方？用过之后，你有没有亲眼看见它被放到哪里？没看见或记不清的部分，直说就好。”",
        "replyToSequence": -12,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:29",
        "eventSequence": -5,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "叶岑对周成说：“明白，你能确认的是停电前见过它在印座上，之后的去向不清楚。”\n“另有一件事想核实：柜台下那个木箱，你知道是谁的、作什么用吗？由谁负责保管？不清楚的部分直说就好。”",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:31",
        "eventSequence": -2,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "叶岑向周成问道：“平日除了你，还有谁会经手或收存铜印？若你知道这样的人，眼下有什么办法能联系到他？我想找了解收存经过的人核实，不是凭谁经手过就认定谁有嫌疑。不清楚的部分直说就好。”",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      },
      {
        "messageId": "message:harness:32",
        "eventSequence": -1,
        "role": "character",
        "speakerKey": "participant.001",
        "audienceKeys": [
          "player",
          "participant.001"
        ],
        "text": "叶岑对周成说：“不必猜，知道的部分直说就好。”",
        "replyToSequence": null,
        "supersededBySequence": null
      }
    ],
